<title>USA: New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 85,486.</title>
<headline>New York certificated cotton stocks rise to 85,486.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Certificated cotton stocks deliverable against New York Cotton Exchange's No. 2 cotton futures contract as of Jan 6 totaled 85,486 bales, up from 83,991 bales the previous session.</p>
<p>There were 1,501 bales issued, no decertification orders, six cancellations, and 4,666 bales awaiting review.</p>
<p>--New York Commodities Desk 212-859-1640</p>
</text>
